<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102463" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τᾰρῑχ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>preserve the body by artificial means, embalm</i>, of
			Egyptian mummies, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.86
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				80c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>preserve</i> food <i>by salting, pickling</i>, or
			<i>smoking</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ὄα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					190d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλᾶν </span>( 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαίαν</span>
			) <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				231.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>:—
				Pass.
			, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰχθύας] ἐξ ἅλμης τεταριχευμένους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.77
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGiss.</u>
				93.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεμάχη
				τεταριχευμένα</span>
			<i>preserved</i> meat, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.4.28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλωρὰ [κάππαρις] πρὶν -ευθῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					6.615
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>season</i> wood by soaking it in water, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.2.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.4.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>macerate</i>, Olymp.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.70
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			metaph. in 
				Pass.
			, <i>waste away, wither</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακῶς ταριχευθέντα παμφθάρτῳ μόρῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					296
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sophr.
				54
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεταριχευμένος</span>
			<i>stale</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεαλὴς καὶ
			πρόσφατος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				25.61
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Medic.,
				<i>reduce</i> a patient <i>by starving</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.595
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
